# taskforge-web/components — EAV port (apps/taskforge-web/components, semsc v0.1).
#
# The 10 reusable HTML component render-operations. Each is an `htmlTemplate`
# island plus a render-operation that hydrates it through `html.render` and
# returns an HtmlFragment for page composition. Converted from the v0.1
# `html template X` / `html body template X` / `html.hydrate.X` forms to EAV
# `X is htmlTemplate` / `X body html` / `html.render arg template HtmlTemplate X`.
# Part of the multi-module taskforge-web port (X-043); HTML rendering execution
# is deferred (target webServer), so this parses + lints clean against
# standard.html.

appTaskforgeWebComponents is module
appTaskforgeWebComponents path apps.taskforgeWeb.components
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderPageShellHead
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderHeroBackground
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderBrandHeader
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderLandingHero
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderFeatureGrid
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderLoginPanel
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderRegisterPanel
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderAuthCard
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderStatusCard
appTaskforgeWebComponents exports renderAppFooter
appTaskforgeWebComponents purpose "Reusable HTML component templates for TaskForge Web pages"
appTaskforgeWebComponents invariant "Each component is one htmlTemplate + one render-operation returning an HtmlFragment"

HtmlFragment is alias
HtmlFragment for String
HtmlFragment purpose "A rendered, escaped HTML fragment composed into pages"

HtmlTemplate is alias
HtmlTemplate for String
HtmlTemplate purpose "A named html template hydrated by html.render"

PageShellHeadComponent is htmlTemplate
PageShellHeadComponent body html
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
  <title>{{pageTitleText}}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://rsms.me/" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://rsms.me/inter/inter.css" />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter var', 'Inter', 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui'] },
          colors: {
            ink: { 50:'#f8fafc', 100:'#f1f5f9', 200:'#e2e8f0', 300:'#cbd5e1', 400:'#94a3b8', 500:'#64748b', 600:'#475569', 700:'#334155', 800:'#1e293b', 900:'#0f172a' },
            brand: { 50:'#eef2ff', 100:'#e0e7ff', 200:'#c7d2fe', 300:'#a5b4fc', 400:'#818cf8', 500:'#6366f1', 600:'#4f46e5', 700:'#4338ca', 800:'#3730a3', 900:'#312e81' },
          },
          boxShadow: {
            'glow-brand': '0 0 0 1px rgba(99,102,241,0.15), 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(99,102,241,0.35)',
            'glow-soft': '0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6) inset, 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(15,23,42,0.15)',
          },
        },
      },
    };
  </script>
  <style>
    :root { font-feature-settings: 'cv11','ss01','ss03'; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter var', 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .mesh-bg {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(at 12% 18%, rgba(165,180,252,0.45) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 88% 22%, rgba(192,132,252,0.40) 0px, transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(at 30% 92%, rgba(125,211,252,0.40) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 80% 80%, rgba(244,114,182,0.25) 0px, transparent 55%);
    }
    .mesh-bg-soft {
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(at 18% 12%, rgba(199,210,254,0.55) 0px, transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(at 92% 28%, rgba(216,180,254,0.40) 0px, transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(at 50% 98%, rgba(186,230,253,0.35) 0px, transparent 50%);
    }
    .glass {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    }
    .glass-dark { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); }
    .ring-soft { box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(15,23,42,0.06), 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18); }
    .grad-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4338ca 0%, #6d28d9 45%, #db2777 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }
    .grad-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 50%, #c026d3 100%); }
    .grad-btn:hover { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4338ca 0%, #6d28d9 50%, #a21caf 100%); }
    @keyframes fade-up { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    .fade-up { animation: fade-up 0.5s ease-out both; }
    @keyframes float-slow { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-10px); } }
    .float-slow { animation: float-slow 8s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
    .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.18); border-radius: 4px; }
    .check-card[data-done="true"] .check-title { text-decoration: line-through; color:  #94a3b8; }
    .check-card[data-done="true"] .check-dot { background: linear-gradient(135deg,  #10b981, #059669); }
  </style>

renderPageShellHead is operation
renderPageShellHead in pageTitleText String
renderPageShellHead out HtmlFragment
renderPageShellHead memory arena request
renderPageShellHead async no
renderPageShellHead purpose "Hydrate the PageShellHeadComponent with a page title — a <head> fragment with Tailwind, Inter, and the design-token style block"
renderPageShellHead invariant "Every page using the modern visual system uses this exact <head>"
renderPageShellHead do hydratePageShellHeadCall
renderPageShellHead return pageShellHeadFragment

hydratePageShellHeadCall is call
hydratePageShellHeadCall in renderPageShellHead
hydratePageShellHeadCall invokes html.render
hydratePageShellHeadCall arg template HtmlTemplate PageShellHeadComponent
hydratePageShellHeadCall arg pageTitleText String pageTitleText
hydratePageShellHeadCall out pageShellHeadFragment HtmlFragment

HeroBackgroundComponent is htmlTemplate
HeroBackgroundComponent body html
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 mesh-bg">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 left-1/4 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-brand-300/30 blur-3xl float-slow"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-300/30 blur-3xl float-slow" style="animation-delay:-3s;"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-10 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-sky-300/25 blur-3xl float-slow" style="animation-delay:-6s;"></div>
  </div>

renderHeroBackground is operation
renderHeroBackground out HtmlFragment
renderHeroBackground memory arena request
renderHeroBackground async no
renderHeroBackground purpose "Hydrate the HeroBackgroundComponent — a fixed decorative mesh-gradient layer with three blurred orbs"
renderHeroBackground invariant "Pure decoration; safe below any page's body open tag"
renderHeroBackground do hydrateHeroBackgroundCall
renderHeroBackground return heroBackgroundFragment

hydrateHeroBackgroundCall is call
hydrateHeroBackgroundCall in renderHeroBackground
hydrateHeroBackgroundCall invokes html.render
hydrateHeroBackgroundCall arg template HtmlTemplate HeroBackgroundComponent
hydrateHeroBackgroundCall out heroBackgroundFragment HtmlFragment

BrandHeaderComponent is htmlTemplate
BrandHeaderComponent body html
  <header class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <a href="/" class="group flex items-center gap-3">
      <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl grad-btn text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-glow-brand transition group-hover:scale-105">T</div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">{{productNameText}}</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-ink-500">{{taglineText}}</div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-200/70 bg-emerald-50/70 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700 shadow-sm">
      <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
        <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-60"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
      </span>
      Server online
    </div>
  </header>

renderBrandHeader is operation
renderBrandHeader in productNameText String
renderBrandHeader in taglineText String
renderBrandHeader out HtmlFragment
renderBrandHeader memory arena request
renderBrandHeader async no
renderBrandHeader purpose "Hydrate the BrandHeaderComponent with product name + tagline"
renderBrandHeader invariant "Returns a self-contained <header> element for a page's header slot"
renderBrandHeader do hydrateBrandHeaderCall
renderBrandHeader return brandHeaderFragment

hydrateBrandHeaderCall is call
hydrateBrandHeaderCall in renderBrandHeader
hydrateBrandHeaderCall invokes html.render
hydrateBrandHeaderCall arg template HtmlTemplate BrandHeaderComponent
hydrateBrandHeaderCall arg productNameText String productNameText
hydrateBrandHeaderCall arg taglineText String taglineText
hydrateBrandHeaderCall out brandHeaderFragment HtmlFragment

LandingHeroComponent is htmlTemplate
LandingHeroComponent body html
  <section class="fade-up flex flex-col justify-center">
    <div class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-200/60 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-700 shadow-sm">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
      {{productNameText}}
      <span class="text-ink-400">&middot;</span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-ink-500">SemanticScript demo</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-[3.25rem]">
      {{headlineText}}
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      {{leadText}}
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-medium">
      <li class="rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-700 shadow-sm">bcrypt cost 12</li>
      <li class="rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-700 shadow-sm">SQLite WAL</li>
      <li class="rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-700 shadow-sm">HttpOnly cookies</li>
      <li class="rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-700 shadow-sm">SameSite=Strict</li>
      <li class="rounded-full border border-ink-200 bg-white/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-700 shadow-sm">Tailwind UI</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

